"Hello, and thanks for joining. I'm reading this from the notch, right under the camera, so my eyes stay where they should.\n\nThe words move at a steady pace, and I can speed them up or slow them down with the arrow keys. Space pauses, and Escape closes the Prompter.\n\nThis window is hidden from screen sharing and recordings, so only I can see it. Everyone else just sees me looking at them.\n\nIn Voice mode the script follows me instead. I read at my own speed, Scout listens on this Mac, and the text keeps up with what I say. If I skip a line, it finds my place again.\n\nThat's all there is to it. Write your own script, press Start, and look into the lens." = "Pozdravljeni in hvala, ker ste se pridružili. To berem iz izreza, tik pod kamero, tako da moje oči ostanejo, kjer morajo.\n\nBesede se premikajo v enakomernem tempu in jih lahko pospešim ali upočasnim s smernimi tipkami. Space ustavi, Escape pa zapre Prompter.\n\nTo okno je skrito pred deljenjem zaslona in posnetki, zato ga vidim samo jaz. Vsi drugi vidijo samo, da gledam vanje.\n\nV načinu Glas skript sledi meni. Berem v svojem tempu, Scout posluša na tem Macu in besedilo gre skupaj s tem, kar rečem. Če preskočim vrstico, spet najde moje mesto.\n\nTo je vse. Napiši svoj skript, pritisni Začni in poglej v objektiv.";
