"Scout can't see your agents' folders yet. Allow it once and every Claude Code and Codex session moves in by itself." = "Scout še ne vidi map tvojih agentov. Dovoli to enkrat in vsaka seja Claude Code in Codex se vseli sama.";
"Scout can't use this microphone" = "Scout ne more uporabljati tega mikrofona";
"Scout could not open a local port." = "Scout ni mogel odpreti lokalnih vrat.";
"Scout couldn't see your screen, so that question went without a picture. Allow Scout under Screen Recording." = "Scout ni videl tvojega zaslona, zato je bilo to vprašanje poslano brez slike. Dovoli Scout v Screen Recording.";
"Scout couldn't take the picture this time, so that question went without it." = "Scout tokrat ni mogel narediti slike, zato je bilo to vprašanje poslano brez nje.";
"Scout finds Claude Code and Codex sessions by itself" = "Scout sam najde seje Claude Code in Codex";
"Scout now listens on port %u (or its hooks are from an older version). Update rewrites only Scout's entries." = "Scout zdaj posluša na vratih %u (ali pa so njegovi hooks iz starejše različice). Posodobitev prepiše samo Scoutove vnose.";
"Scout only watches for connections once you allow it." = "Scout spremlja povezave šele, ko to dovoliš.";
"Scout reads your events on this Mac to fill the Calendar widget and workspace. Nothing is sent anywhere." = "Scout bere tvoje dogodke na tem Macu, da zapolni pripomoček Koledar in delovni prostor. Nič se ne pošlje nikamor.";
"Scout remembers what you copy so you can paste it again from the notch or the bottom shelf. Everything stays on this Mac." = "Scout si zapomni, kaj kopiraš, da lahko to znova prilepiš iz izreza ali spodnje police. Vse ostane na tem Macu.";
"Scout will add its hooks to %@ after backing the file up." = "Scout bo dodal svoje hooks v %@, potem ko varnostno kopira datoteko.";
"Scout's own code, words and icon are original. Everything else here is used under its own license." = "Scoutova koda, besede in ikona so izvirne. Vse drugo tu se uporablja pod lastno licenco.";
"Scout's own windows (Ask AI, notes, to-dos, the calculator and the others) reopen where they were, with their size and their text, after a quit, an update or a restart. When a display is no longer there they open on the main one." = "Scoutova okna (Vprašaj UI, beležke, opravila, kalkulator in druga) se po izhodu, posodobitvi ali ponovnem zagonu znova odprejo tam, kjer so bila, s svojo velikostjo in besedilom. Ko zaslona ni več, se odprejo na glavnem.";
