"The %@ uses the camera, so it never opens by itself" = "%@ uporablja kamero, zato se nikoli ne odpre samo";
"The + at the left of the notch's top row starts a tab in a folder you pick: your login shell goes to the folder, then runs the command, so your PATH and the agent's own sign-in apply. Each tab is a widget on the dashboard that opens into its terminal, and it keeps running while the notch is closed. After Scout restarts the tabs come back by themselves, each in its folder, and the agents continue with the resume command; with that switched off they wait under + › Resume instead." = "+ levo v zgornji vrstici izreza začne zavihek v mapi, ki jo izbereš: tvoj login shell gre v mapo, nato zažene ukaz, zato veljata tvoj PATH in agentova prijava. Vsak zavihek je pripomoček na nadzorni plošči, ki se odpre v svoj terminal in teče naprej, tudi ko je izrez zaprt. Po ponovnem zagonu Scouta se zavihki vrnejo sami, vsak v svoji mapi, agenti pa nadaljujejo z ukazom za nadaljevanje; ko je to izklopljeno, čakajo pod + › Nadaljuj.";
"The 8-bit look, light or dark, colours, sizes and styles." = "Videz 8-bit, svetel ali temen, barve, velikosti in slogi.";
"The 90s look: pixel agents, chunky keys, LCD digits." = "Videz iz 90. let: slikovni agenti, debele tipke, števke LCD.";
"The Mirror widget. Video never leaves your Mac." = "Pripomoček Ogledalo. Video nikoli ne zapusti tvojega Maca.";
"The Prompter sits right under the camera and is hidden from screen sharing and recordings. Steady scrolls at a set speed: ↑ and ↓ (or scrolling) change it, Space pauses, Esc closes." = "Prompter je tik pod kamero in skrit pred deljenjem zaslona in posnetki. Enakomerno se pomika z določeno hitrostjo: ↑ in ↓ (ali pomikanje) jo spremenita, Space ustavi, Esc zapre.";
"The archive is too big for a ZIP file (4 GB limit)" = "Arhiv je prevelik za datoteko ZIP (omejitev 4 GB)";
"The camera runs only while the Mirror tab or widget is on screen. The camera key under the picture copies a picture of it to the clipboard; Share makes a polaroid with your agents and shows it before anything is shared. macOS asks for camera access the first time you press the button to turn it on. External and iPhone cameras show up in the list." = "Kamera teče samo, ko je zavihek ali pripomoček Ogledalo na zaslonu. Gumb kamere pod sliko kopira njeno sliko v odložišče; Deli naredi polaroid z agenti in ga pokaže, preden se karkoli deli. macOS prvič vpraša za dostop do kamere, ko pritisneš gumb za vklop. Zunanje kamere in kamere iPhone se prikažejo na seznamu.";
"The clipboard history." = "Zgodovina odložišča.";
"The countdown appears next to the notch and shows the title when you rest the pointer on it. Zoom, Google Meet, Teams and Webex links get a Join button." = "Odštevanje se prikaže ob izrezu in pokaže naslov, ko miško zadržiš nad njim. Povezave Zoom, Google Meet, Teams in Webex dobijo gumb Vstopi.";
"The download failed" = "Prenos ni uspel";
"The export failed" = "Izvoz ni uspel";
"The folder %@ starts in" = "Mapa, v kateri se %@ začne";
"The icons along the open notch: click one and it opens; the dashboard tab goes back. They start left of the camera and carry on to its right; the Mirror always stands right of it. The lock key next to the gear keeps the tab you are on as the one the notch opens on, instead of the dashboard; press it again to let go. At least one tab stays on." = "Ikone ob odprtem izrezu: klikni eno in se odpre; zavihek nadzorne plošče gre nazaj. Začnejo se levo od kamere in se nadaljujejo desno od nje; Ogledalo je vedno desno od nje. Gumb s ključavnico ob zobnika obdrži zavihek, v katerem si, kot tistega, na katerem se izrez odpre namesto nadzorne plošče; pritisni znova, da ga spustiš. Vsaj en zavihek ostane vklopljen.";
