"The open notch is as wide as the widgets on your dashboard, up to this width." = "Odprti izrez je tako širok kot pripomočki na tvoji nadzorni plošči, do te širine.";
"The open notch is one dashboard: the Agents widget and the Ask AI line are always there, and music, a meeting about to start, a timer, a download, a recording, AirPods and open to-dos show up by themselves while they are live. Click a widget and it grows into its full view; Esc goes back, a second Esc closes. Pinned widgets always show, next to the live ones: pin or unpin them here, arrange them by hand with Edit Nook (or right-click a widget)." = "Odprti izrez je ena nadzorna plošča: pripomoček Agenti in vrstica Vprašaj UI sta vedno tam, glasba, sestanek, ki se kmalu začne, časovnik, prenos, snemanje, AirPods in odprta opravila pa se prikažejo sami, dokler so aktivni. Klikni pripomoček in zraste v poln pogled; Esc gre nazaj, drugi Esc zapre. Pripeti pripomočki so vedno vidni, ob aktivnih: pripni ali odpni jih tu, ročno jih razporedi z Uredi Nook (ali z desnim klikom na pripomoček).";
