"Voice mode listens on this Mac and keeps your place as you read. Nothing is sent anywhere. macOS asks for the Microphone and Speech Recognition the first time you use it. When the words can't be recognised (a language this Mac can't recognise offline, or Dictation turned off in System Settings › Keyboard), Scout follows the sound of your voice instead: the text moves while you speak and waits when you stop." = "Način Glas posluša na tem Macu in sledi tvojemu mestu med branjem. Nič se ne pošlje nikamor. macOS ob prvi uporabi vpraša za Mikrofon in Prepoznavanje govora. Ko besed ni mogoče prepoznati (jezik, ki ga ta Mac brez povezave ne more prepoznati, ali izklopljen Dictation v System Settings › Keyboard), Scout namesto tega sledi zvoku tvojega glasu: besedilo se premika, ko govoriš, in počaka, ko utihneš.";
